{"seq":2,"slug":"locality-and-modularity","title":"局部性与模块化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/legibility-and-navigation/locality-and-modularity","wordCount":1868,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"局部性与模块化\">局部性与模块化</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>agent 工作在一个又贵又有限的资源约束下：上下文窗口。Anthropic 的多 agent 研究系统报告给出了两端的数字——并行子 agent（各自持有独立上下文）让系统在其内部研究评测上超出单 agent 90.2%，但多 agent 架构消耗的 token 约为普通对话的 15 倍（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/built-multi-agent-research-system\">Anthropic Engineering</a>）。token 有价、窗口装不下「整片系统」，于是架构问题被重新表述为：<strong>一次改动所需的全部理解，能否落进一个小到装得下的局部？</strong> 这就是局部性；模块化是制造局部性的手段。本节给出改动半径的度量方法、模块化如何创造局部性、并行开发如何把模块边界变成物理事实，以及破坏局部性的四种模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把局部性拆成几个可用的定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>局部性</strong>：一次改动所需的全部理解，能落进一个小到装得下的上下文区间。</li>\n<li><strong>改动半径</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>某类改动</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(\\text{某类改动})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">某类改动</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> = 完成该类改动需理解并修改的文件数期望；半径小则推理可闭合，半径大则只能采样部分证据就动手。</li>\n<li><strong>模块化是制造局部性的手段</strong>：信息隐藏、深模块窄接口、单向依赖——经典配方在 agent 时代变得更值钱。</li>\n<li><strong>边界即协作物理边界</strong>：并行 agent 时，模块接口越窄，合并冲突面越小；全局状态与共享大文件是并行 agent 的死锁温床。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"改动半径决定-agent-的成败\">改动半径决定 agent 的成败</h2><p>把「AI 友好度」定义成可测量的量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>某类改动</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext>完成该类改动需理解并修改的文件数</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(\\text{某类改动}) = \\mathbb{E}[\\,\\text{完成该类改动需理解并修改的文件数}\\,]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">某类改动</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">完成该类改动需理解并修改的文件数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>半径小，agent 能把全部相关文件装进上下文、闭合推理、可靠完成；半径大，它只能采样部分证据就动手——改对一半、漏一半，留下最难查的静默缺陷。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 可以直接从 git 历史估计：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"commits=$(git rev-list --count --since=&#39;3 months ago&#39; HEAD)&#10;files=$(git log --since=&#39;3 months ago&#39; --pretty=format: --name-only | grep -c .)&#10;echo &quot;平均每次提交触及 $((files / commits)) 个文件&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">commits</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rev-list</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --count</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --since=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3 months ago'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">files</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --since=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3 months ago'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --pretty=format:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name-only</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"平均每次提交触及 $((</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">files</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> / commits)) 个文件\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是本节的原创综合：量纲朴素，但足以指导决策——<strong>高频路径上的改动半径应当作为架构评审的一等指标</strong>，与性能预算同等对待。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模块化创造局部性\">模块化创造局部性</h2><p>经典理论早已给出配方，agent 时代只是让它变得更值钱：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>信息隐藏</strong>：Parnas 在 1972 年的经典论文《On the Criteria To Be Used in Decomposing Systems into Modules》（CACM）中论证，模块划分应围绕「难以预测的设计决策」而非工序步骤，让易变的部分藏在稳定接口之后。</li>\n<li><strong>深模块、窄接口</strong>：Ousterhout 在《A Philosophy of Software Design》中把理想模块定义为「简单接口背后封装大量功能」——使用者需要了解的东西最少，而收益最大；这一原则如何落成边界设计与多 agent 任务分配，见<a href=\"../context-and-boundaries/bounded-modules-narrow-interfaces\">有界模块与窄接口</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>「窄接口」还可以量化。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为某包对外发出的依赖数（efferent coupling）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为指向它的依赖数（afferent coupling），Robert Martin 定义的不稳定度为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = \\frac{C_e}{C_a + C_e} \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I \\approx 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的包是稳定底座（被众人依赖而不依赖别人），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I \\approx 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是易变的消费端。健康的依赖图大体从稳定指向不稳定；出现环，或高稳定包反向依赖低稳定包时，局部性已被破坏，agent 的「影响范围推理」随之失效。</p>\n<p>工具生态也在向同一方向收敛。Anthropic 提出「以代码方式调用 MCP 工具」：agent 按需读取当前任务需要的工具定义，而不是把所有定义塞进上下文，实测把单任务 token 从约 15 万压到约 2 千、节省 98.7%；Cloudflare 称类似方案为 Code Mode（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/code-execution-with-mcp\">Code execution with MCP</a>）。本质是把「工具面」也做成可局部加载的模块——上下文的局部性原则，从代码库一路贯穿到了工具层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph BAD[&quot;大半径反模式&quot;]&#10;    UI1[&quot;UI 组件&quot;] --&gt; SRV1[&quot;service 层&quot;]&#10;    SRV1 --&gt; DAO1[&quot;DAO 层&quot;]&#10;    DAO1 --&gt; GS[&quot;全局状态单例&quot;]&#10;    SRV2[&quot;另一处 service&quot;] -.暗改.-&gt; GS&#10;    UI2[&quot;看似无关组件&quot;] -.读取同一全局.-&gt; GS&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph GOOD[&quot;小半径模块&quot;]&#10;    M1[&quot;refund 模块&lt;br/&gt;入口+逻辑+存储&quot;] --&gt; I1[&quot;窄接口&quot;]&#10;    APP[&quot;其他模块&quot;] --&gt; I1&#10;  end\">graph LR\n  subgraph BAD[\"大半径反模式\"]\n    UI1[\"UI 组件\"] --&gt; SRV1[\"service 层\"]\n    SRV1 --&gt; DAO1[\"DAO 层\"]\n    DAO1 --&gt; GS[\"全局状态单例\"]\n    SRV2[\"另一处 service\"] -.暗改.-&gt; GS\n    UI2[\"看似无关组件\"] -.读取同一全局.-&gt; GS\n  end\n  subgraph GOOD[\"小半径模块\"]\n    M1[\"refund 模块&lt;br/&gt;入口+逻辑+存储\"] --&gt; I1[\"窄接口\"]\n    APP[\"其他模块\"] --&gt; I1\n  end</pre><h2 id=\"并行开发把边界变成物理事实\">并行开发把边界变成物理事实</h2><p>多 agent 并行写代码时，模块边界不再只是概念——它决定冲突面。git 的 worktree 机制允许同一仓库检出多个工作树，各自挂独立分支互不干扰（<a href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-worktree\">git-worktree 文档</a>）；Claude Code 官方工作流明确收录了「用 worktree 跑并行会话」（<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/common-workflows\">common workflows</a>）。这与多 agent 系统的设计结论一致：子 agent 各自带独立上下文、分离的工具与探索轨迹，能降低路径依赖、支持彻底的并行调查（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/built-multi-agent-research-system\">multi-agent 博客</a>）。worktree 隔离如何与按风险的自主度分级配合，另见<a href=\"../verifiability-and-safe-change/small-reversible-changes\">小步可逆的变更</a>。</p>\n<p>由此得到一条值得写进架构准则的推论：<strong>模块接口越窄，并行 agent 的合并冲突面越小</strong>。高内聚让每个 agent 的改动集自然聚簇，低耦合让分支合并无需人工仲裁。反之，全局状态与共享大文件是并行 agent 的死锁温床——两个 agent 各改一处，合并时互相覆盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"局部性的反面与代价\">局部性的反面与代价</h2><p>四类破坏者，前三类是「看不见的远距离」，第四类是矫枉过正：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>为什么毁掉局部性</th>\n<th>替代做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局可变状态</td>\n<td>任何代码都可能改它，局部推理失效</td>\n<td>显式传参、依赖注入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串约定的远程耦合</td>\n<td>共享 key/事件名在两处绑定，改一处看不到另一处</td>\n<td>类型化常量、单一出处</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过早抽象</td>\n<td>简单改动被打散到多个间接层</td>\n<td>允许重复，第三次再抽象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切片过碎</td>\n<td>一次改动要跳十个文件才能闭合</td>\n<td>按变化频率重组模块</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一条的判断标准是变化频率而非分类学：<strong>应该一起变的放在一起，不该一起变的隔开</strong>。模块数量本身既非目标也非罪过——为复用而拆出的层若迫使高频改动横跨五六个文件，它就是负资产；agent 时代对过度工程的惩罚来得比以前更快，因为每层间接都是 agent 必须付费阅读的 token。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>给改动半径定预算</strong>：例如「核心域高频改动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\le 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>」。超标不禁提交，但自动生成一条重构工单——像监控 p99 延迟一样持续观测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，而不是搞一次性重构运动。</li>\n<li><strong>新模块先评审接口再写实现</strong>：只问一个问题——「调用方为了正确使用它必须知道几件事？」答案超过三条就继续收窄。</li>\n<li><strong>并行任务先切边界再开工</strong>：按模块划分各 agent 的工作树与分支归属，禁止两个 agent 同时持有同一文件的写权；worktree 目录名带上任务编号，方便回收清理。</li>\n<li><strong>登记隐形连线</strong>：发现全局单例读写、裸字符串 key、跨模块共享的数据库列语义时，当场把关联双方改成显式依赖——这类连线不会出现在任何 import 图里，只有纪律能拦住它们。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>局部性把「理解一片」压缩成「理解一块」，改动半径给了它可测量、可预算的形式。信息隐藏、深模块窄接口与单向依赖是三件老工具，worktree 式并行则把模块边界变成协作的物理边界。当 token 有价、上下文有限，压缩改动半径就是在压缩 agent 出错的概率。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"局部性与模块化","id":"局部性与模块化"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"改动半径决定 agent 的成败","id":"改动半径决定-agent-的成败"},{"level":2,"text":"模块化创造局部性","id":"模块化创造局部性"},{"level":2,"text":"并行开发把边界变成物理事实","id":"并行开发把边界变成物理事实"},{"level":2,"text":"局部性的反面与代价","id":"局部性的反面与代价"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"清晰的结构与命名","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/legibility-and-navigation/clear-structure-and-naming"},"next":{"title":"显式胜于隐式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/legibility-and-navigation/explicit-over-implicit"}}